&lt;li&gt;Availability to work across days, evenings, and weekends as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Student-oriented mindset with a focus on understanding learner needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to take on this challenge as a part-time external contractor alongside a current job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
