&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Technical Skills – School of Cyber&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;cybersecurity fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt; (network, application, and system security)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
