&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical competence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Statistical Foundations, Data Wrangling, Visualization &amp;amp; Storytelling, Product KPIs, Data Pipeline, Data Modeling &amp;amp; Storage, Strong understanding of Experiment Design (A/B Testing, Multivariate) and statistical inference, product management frameworks (e.g., RICE, Iterative Design). Product Development, Rapid Prototyping, User-Centered Design, Product Strategy, Go-To-Market Strategy, Basic knowledge of SQL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
