&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why should you apply?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain recognition for your technical knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn additional income&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a vibrant, global student community&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on the latest cutting-edge technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are only&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Limited open positions&lt;/strong&gt;, so please don’t wait too long to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Technical Mentors&amp;nbsp;work independently and set their own schedule. However, the above-mentioned opportunities are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;subjected to a specific schedule and agenda&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; If selected you would be provided with access to the Mentorship Nanodegree program. You are requested to graduate from the Mentorship Nanodegree in order to be onboarded as a Technical Mentor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
